## What you can expect

- Clear communication and fast turnaround where possible
- Advice on print orientation, strength, and tolerances
- Clean prints with quality checks before dispatch

## Best for

- Brackets, adapters, clips, covers
- Prototypes and iterative design work
- Durable parts (heat/UV resistance available with the right material)

## Materials (FDM)

We offer **PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, TPU, nylon** and **carbon-fibre composite** options.
If you’re not sure, describe the use case and we’ll recommend a material.

## Same-day option

Same-day local delivery in Cambridgeshire is available **on request**, depending on the job and workload.

